{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>FormCheck+ 是一款結合重訓姿勢檢查、訓練記錄與進度追蹤的健身應用，適合健力、健美、CrossFit、跑步及一般健身愛好者，亦涵蓋初階至進階訓練者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，可用人工智能分析動作並提供矯正與風險提示。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-160.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>重訓姿勢分析與進度追蹤</h2>\n<p>FormCheck+ 透過人工智能提供口語分析回饋，涵蓋動作矯正建議、風險評估、AI 教練對話與技巧檢查清單，並可推薦重訓裝備。你亦可上載進度照片、監測體重與身體測量、以清單及 PR 儀錶板追蹤目標，記錄有氧與重訓，配合肌肉儀錶板、智能訓練日曆及槓片計算器安排訓練。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-22.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-23.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-24.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-25.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-26.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：FormCheck+</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/formcheck/id6759869973?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.800265+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":320,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T05:29:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:30.458401+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:38.205475+00:00","content_hash":"9b70aa4b85b416217ef7296136f593b5b0a429e61c8f43525194926e4bd62dc9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}